{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40493","headline":"武德殿朝退望九衢春色 · 曹松","name":"武德殿朝退望九衢春色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉殿朝初退，天街一看春。\n南山初过雨，北阙净无尘。\n夹道夭桃满，连沟御柳新。\n苏舒同舜泽，煦妪竝尧仁。\n佳气浮轩盖，和风袭缙绅。\n自兹怜万物，同入发生辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}